    },
    {
      "_id": "Z4FRBTW4OWs1AjI5",
      "name": "Eye Rays (DC 18)",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/delapouite/all-seeing-eye.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A retriever’s eyes can produce four different magical rays with a range of 100 feet. Each round, it can fire one ray, as a free action. An individual ray is usable only once every 4 rounds. It can fire an eye ray in the same round as it makes physical attacks. The save DC for all rays is 10 + 1/2 the retriever’s Hit Dice + the retriever’s Dexterity modifier. The four eye effects are:</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst3.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.F9sDg5FHLKUqVnLh.JournalEntryPage.M5YY3kCExBHCkFHu",
        "source": "Urban Arcana",
        "abilityType": "supernatural",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!WEHqxJYoES4YJDiF.Z4FRBTW4OWs1AjI5"
    },
    {
      "_id": "vC2SD9uXC7mUVHd1",
      "name": "Fast Healing 5",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/delapouite/healing.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Retrievers regain 5 hit points per round. Fast healing stops working when the retriever is reduced to 0 hit points or fewer.</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst3.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.F9sDg5FHLKUqVnLh.JournalEntryPage.M5YY3kCExBHCkFHu",
        "source": "Urban Arcana",
        "abilityType": "extraordinary",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!WEHqxJYoES4YJDiF.vC2SD9uXC7mUVHd1"
    },
    {
      "_id": "7IptWF10h6abkRib",
      "name": "Find Target",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/scroll-unfurled.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>When ordered to find an item or being, a retriever does so unerringly, as though guided by discern location. The being giving the order must have seen (or have an item belonging to) the creature to be found, or have touched the object to be located. This ability is the equivalent of an 8th-level spell.</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst3.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.F9sDg5FHLKUqVnLh.JournalEntryPage.M5YY3kCExBHCkFHu",
        "source": "Urban Arcana",
        "abilityType": "spellLike",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!WEHqxJYoES4YJDiF.7IptWF10h6abkRib"
    },
    {
      "_id": "QO2ZveaszPhxaErS",
      "name": "Improved Grab",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/grab.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>To use this ability, the retriever must hit with its bite attack. If it wins the grapple check, it establishes a hold and grips the opponent fast in its mouth. This is how it usually “retrieves” things.</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst3.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.F9sDg5FHLKUqVnLh.JournalEntryPage.M5YY3kCExBHCkFHu",
